### Calls with a bearer token. Run from Visual Studio, Rider or VS Code (REST Client). Start the app first.
@host = http://localhost:5211

### 1. Get a token
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "admin", "password": "admin" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 2. Default scheme with a token -> 200, authenticatedBy is JwtBearer's
GET {{host}}/api/secret
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Bearer-only endpoint -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/bearer-only
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Policy with a token -> 200 for admin
GET {{host}}/api/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. No token, no cookie -> 401 (an API endpoint doesn't redirect to the login page)
GET {{host}}/api/secret
